{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>銀行、電子錢包與加密貨幣分散在不同地方，往往說不出一個真實總數。All Banks 讓你在約一分鐘內，以自訂貨幣看到唯一的淨資產數字，適合不願把銀行登入資料交給第三方、又想掌握整體財務狀況的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費；一次購買即可使用，沒有訂閱與廣告。</p>\n\n<h2>多幣種資產與債務一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>All Banks 以完全手動方式運作，你只要輸入各帳戶餘額，便即時得出資產減去負債的淨資產，並換算成主要貨幣的單一數字。支援美元、歐元、英鎊等多種貨幣，也可把 BTC、ETH、USDT、USDC 與現金並列追蹤，貸款餘額與下次還款日同樣清楚可見。資料只存放於 iPhone，可選擇以 iCloud 同步，開發者不收集任何資料。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-339-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-340-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-341-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-342-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-343-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-344-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：All Banks – Net Worth Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T07:58:01.063524+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}